<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<scheme version="2.0" title="3차시 ① 우리 동네 대기환경에서 조건으로 날 고르기 (완성)" description="교육용 가상 데이터 실습 워크플로. data/weekly 폴더와 orange3 폴더를 키트의 폴더 구조 그대로 두고 여세요.">
	<nodes>
		<node id="0" name="File" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.data.owfile.OWFile" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="File (파일 불러오기)" position="(120.0, 320.0)" />
		<node id="1" name="Select Rows" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.data.owselectrows.OWSelectRows" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="Select Rows (행 고르기)" position="(300.0, 320.0)" />
		<node id="2" name="Data Table" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.data.owtable.OWTable" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="Data Table (고른 날)" position="(480.0, 320.0)" />
		<node id="3" name="Distributions" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.visualize.owdistributions.OWDistributions" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="Distributions (분포 막대)" position="(300.0, 460.0)" />
	</nodes>
	<links>
		<link id="0" source_node_id="0" sink_node_id="1" source_channel="Data" sink_channel="Data" enabled="true" source_channel_id="data" sink_channel_id="data" />
		<link id="1" source_node_id="1" sink_node_id="2" source_channel="Matching Data" sink_channel="Data" enabled="true" source_channel_id="matching_data" sink_channel_id="data" />
		<link id="2" source_node_id="0" sink_node_id="3" source_channel="Data" sink_channel="Data" enabled="true" source_channel_id="data" sink_channel_id="data" />
	</links>
	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(40.0, 30.0, 760.0, 190.0)" font-size="16">완성본: File → Select Rows(PM10_ug_m3 is greater than 80) → Data Table, File → Distributions(등급).
더 해 보기: Select Rows에 조건 습도_pct is greater than 70을 하나 더 넣으면 남는 날이 줄어듭니다.</text>
	</annotations>
